      "title": "Token golden vectors pass in Go and C++; issue p99 < 100 ms at 100/s",
      "class": "N", "platforms": ["linux", "windows"],
      "threshold": "Golden vectors byte-exact in Go and C++; connect-token issue p99 < 100 ms at 100 requests/s",
      "status": "partial",
      "tests": [
