      "id": "GP-1", "phase": 0, "source": "06 §12.2", "owner": "WP-0.19",
      "title": "Gameplay kernel corpus clauses",
      "class": "N", "platforms": ["linux", "windows"],
      "threshold": "200 golden builds within 1e-9 and bit-identical on MSVC, GCC and Clang; C++ and Go HXL agree on 100 % of the corpus (≥ 1,000 FMA-sensitive vectors) on windows/amd64, linux/amd64 at GOAMD64=v1 and v3, and linux/arm64; hxlfloat lint clean and catching 100 % of its planted violations",
      "status": "unmeasured",
